<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Paper - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Paper - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 92.01		vs	   88.33</p>
<p> Operating	    5.85		vs	    6.06</p>
<p> Current		4.83		vs	    4.55</p>
<p> Net		    2.47		vs	    2.32</p>
<p> EPS		    7.57 yen	  vs	    7.13 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    326 million	  vs	 326 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Paper Mills Ltd is a large paper manufacturer.</p>
